  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This gravity core was taken together with a longer piston core to recover a less disturbed section of the upper 1.5m of the seafloor sediments. The purpose is the study of physical proxies, geochemical tracers and microfossils to reconstruct climatic controlled freshwater discharge variations due to warming and cooling during the past 4000 years."
